# Browser
# What the page asks for Mana Flare's "one mana of any type that land produced" (CR 106.12a) when the land produced two
# types: Azorius Chancery's {W}{U}. The dock asks which type of mana to add, its buttons the two types the land produced
# and no other; the person clicks {U}, and the pool shows one white and two blue.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mana Flare
Azorius Chancery
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Mana Flare.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Azorius Chancery.Play
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Azorius Chancery.Activate
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Choose which type of mana to add
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Modes = {W}; {U}
Bot1.Modes({U})
? Client.Bot1.Mana = 1 White; 2 Blue

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Mana = {W}{U}{U}
